	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE: MCU\n* 100 nF caps on the U1 side of the board, <2 mm from each VDD pin, via straight to GND plane.\n* Y2 and C58/C59 within 5 mm of PF0/PF1; GND pour around, no other traces under Y2.\n* VDDA/VREF+ caps at pins 28/29; feed +3V3A from FB1 as its own trace.\n* 1 nF ISENSE caps next to PC0-PC2; route DRV_SOx as a group away from SW and phase copper."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 114.3 83.82 0)
		(size 150 27.94)
		(margins 2.25 2.25 2.25 2.25)
